			"date": "2025-06-06T15:19:21.792Z",
			"content": "<p>I’m reminded that Meta provided Facebook Messenger messages to law enforcement and helped put this Nebraska woman in jail for two years: <a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2022/08/12/1117092169/nebraska-cops-used-facebook-messages-to-investigate-an-alleged-illegal-abortion\">www.npr.org/2022/08/12/1...</a></p>\n<p>Think about what Meta could provide to law enforcement with private web browsing activity.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
